like]] [[the]] [[wind]], [[and]] [[suddenly]] [[the]] [[ball]] [[was|be]] [[at]] Cuong's [[feet|foot]].`,`vn`:`M\u1edbi m\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u00fat, ph\u1ed1 Tre \u0111\u00e3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t l\u00ean d\u1eabn tr\u01b0\u1edbc. C\u1ea7u th\u1ee7 s\u1ed1 ch\u00edn cao l\u00eau ngh\u00eau c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd s\u00fat b\u00f3ng qua Na, th\u1eb3ng v\u00e0o l\u01b0\u1edbi. Nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea7n n\u00e0y, kh\u00f4ng ai ng\u1eebng ch\u1ea1y. Quang lao vun v\u00fat d\u1ecdc bi\u00ean nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u01a1n gi\u00f3, v\u00e0 b\u1ed7ng nhi\u00ean qu\u1ea3 b\u00f3ng \u0111\u00e3 n\u1eb1m d\u01b0\u1edbi ch\u00e2n C\u01b0\u1eddng.`},{`en`:`Cuong [[was|be]] [[so]] [[excited]] [[that]] [[he]] [[picked|pick]] [[the]] [[ball]] [[up]] [[with]] [[both]] [[hands|hand]]. [[Then]] [[he]] [[ran|run]] [[towards]] [[the]] [[goal]] [[with]] [[it]], [[like]] [[a]] [[rugby]] [[player]]. \`Cuong!\` Na [[shouted|shout]] [[from]] [[her]] [[goal]]. \`[[This]] [[is|be]] [[not]] [[rugby]]!\` [[Even]] [[the]] Bamboo Street [[supporters|supporter]] [[laughed|laugh]]. [[It]] [[was|be]] [[the]] [[best]] [[entertainment]] [[of]] [[the]] [[afternoon]].`,`vn`:`C\u01b0\u1eddng ph\u1ea5n kh\u00edch \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ee9c c\u00fai xu\u1ed1ng \u00f4m b\u00f3ng b\u1eb1ng c\u1ea3 hai tay. R\u1ed3i c\u1eadu \u00f4m b\u00f3ng lao v\u1ec1 ph\u00eda khung th\u00e0nh, y nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u1ea7u th\u1ee7 b\u00f3ng b\u1ea7u d\u1ee5c. \`C\u01b0\u1eddng!\` Na h\u00e9t l\u00ean t\u1eeb khung th\u00e0nh. \`\u0110\u00e2y \u0111\u00e2u ph\u1ea3i b\u00f3ng b\u1ea7u d\u1ee5c!\` \u0110\u1ebfn c\u1ed5 \u0111\u1ed9ng vi\u00ean ph\u1ed1 Tre c\u0169ng ph\u00e1 l\u00ean c\u01b0\u1eddi. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 m\u00e0n gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed vui nh\u1ea5t bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u h\u00f4m \u1ea5y.`},{`en`:`[[In]] [[the]] [[second]] [[half]], Lotus Street [[played|play]] [[like]] [[a]] [[team]], [[and]] Na [[caught|catch]] [[everything]]. [[Five]] [[minutes|minute]] [[before]] [[the]] [[end]], Bin [[ran|run]] [[between]] [[two]] [[pairs|pair]] [[of]]